  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">A little bag with limitless possibilities, our Plaza is the perfect go-everywhere design—with a sophisticated New York attitude. Inspired by effortlessly cool Coach patchwork styles from the early 2000s, this compact 25 is crafted in a mix of luxe leathers and our Signature jacquard. With space for all your day-to-day essentials including a phone, wallet, keys and more, wear it as a short shoulder bag or wristlet.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Signature jacquard, vachetta leather, nappa leather, soft grain leather and suede</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> N/A</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">9.75&quot; (L) x 5.25&quot; (H) x 1.75&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Handle with 8&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
